---
title: "One step of a run"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: accepted
    lg1: attention
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 orange
  s0: Accepted, nothing waiting
  s1: Accepted, an input waiting
  s2: Step refused, retry pending
  s3: Engine fault, run stopped
  s4: Accepted, an input due
  s5: Accepted, a fence ahead
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an input arrives
  s0 --> s2: refused whole, nothing changes
  s0 --> s3: no shorter span is left
  s1 --> s2: refused whole, nothing changes or the cut at the input is refused
  s1 --> s4: stops at the waiting input or lands on a guard and fires
  s1 --> s3: no shorter span is left
  s2 --> s0: the shorter retry is accepted or lands on a guard and fires
  s2 --> s3: no shorter span is left
  s0 --> s4: an input arrives
  s2 --> s4: the shorter retry is accepted or lands on a guard and fires
  s2 --> s1: the shorter retry is accepted or lands on a guard and fires
  s2 --> s5: the shorter retry is accepted
  s4 --> s0: accepted whole
  s5 --> s4: stops at the waiting input
  class s0 teal
  class s1 teal
  class s2 orange
  class s3 orange
  class s4 teal
  class s5 teal
